  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/VirtualDrivers/Virtual-Display-Driver/zipball/25.7.23",
  "body": "The new installer-less, portable **Virtual Driver Control** app now supports Installing and Uninstalling from the app itself, along with using the RELOAD_DRIVER functionality across all context menus, removing the RESTART_DRIVER functionality entirely outside of the command line.\r\n\r\n- **Virtual Driver Control** is now **officially signed** for security purposes.\r\n- **Includes Signed Virtual Display Driver** (Install/Uninstall, Enable/Disable).\r\n- **Includes Signed Virtual Audio Driver** (Install/Uninstall, Enable/Disable).\r\n- Alpha Feature: **XML Editor** (May have errors.)\r\n- **Fixed Win 10 Installation Issue**\r\n- **Fixed RESTART_DRIVER function**\r\n\r\n<img width=\"650\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56ee9d46-3990-4271-9f01-72b1d56081d1\" />\r\n\r\nNote: ARM64 users still need to use the manual installation method, or the installation .ps1 community script(s).\r\n\r\n### Installation Video\r\n\r\n[<img width=\"400\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/383d840c-8327-439b-a89b-84b271320371\" />](https://youtu.be/jN5YnHlC0fE)",
